  "description": "Ready when you are. The File Plus combines discreet, powerful e-assistance with a naturally light ride feel and smart integration that lets you stay close to the trail and your bike. - TQ-HPR60 motor - light, quiet, powerful (60 Nm, 350 W) - 580 Wh battery - long range with low weight, fully charged in 3 hours - 150/140 mm suspension travel - optimum balance for climbing efficiency and trail performance - Adapted geometry - long reach, flat steering angle, low centre of gravity - Angle-adjust headset - adjustable head tube angle (64° / 65°) for customised handling - Sophisticated kinematics - sensitive response, progressive on hard impacts - Fully integrated: Motor, display & controls seamlessly integrated into the frame - TQ E-Bike App: Personalisation of riding modes, real-time data & support available at all times - Clever cockpit: Customised details for a tidy, minimalist design The File Plus is based on a well thought-out overall system: From the efficient TQ-HPR60 drive to the harmonised kinematics and the consistent lines of the carbon frame, everything is designed for control, dynamics and riding ease. The geometry ensures a smooth ride even at high speeds, the suspension reacts sensitively and offers reserves when it counts – for precise handling and consistent performance on any trail. ¹ approx. 20.3 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for soil frame, size L, without pedals.",
